<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SCI Systems reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SCI Systems reinstated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said analyst Todd Newman reinstated SCI Systems Inc as near-term accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Newman estimated earnings in the range of $3.27-$3.30 for the 1997 year, ending in June, and range of $3.90-$4.00 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month price target of mid to high 60s.</p>
<p>-- Shares jumped 2-3/8 to 60.</p>
</text>
